    "notes": "Advanced side (back of the modern 1961 card), bottom card of a 972x1600 flatbed scan of three 1961 backs, from a 2019 collector's post of his Bill Virdon Strat-O-Matic cards (Wayback capture); read from a 0.62x whole-scan overview, then a second independent pass over 1.9x per-grid crops. Situation glyphs captured as markers: omega (LHP col1 r4, col2 r8; RHP col2 r8/r10), downTriangle (LHP col1 r10, col2 r11; RHP col1 r10, col2 r11), upTriangle (LHP col3 r2, RHP col1 r2; default result plus the italic SI*/lo split printed beneath), diamond (RHP col2 r2). '?' after fly balls captured as questionMark; underlined C as 'underline:C'. 'plus injury' on LHP col1 r12 and RHP col3 r12."
